   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "In this scene, Anya arrives at the kitchen of restaurant Claude Monet on a very tense morning. The cooks are whispering nervously because Chef Viktor Barinov is approaching in a terrible mood. Listen to the Russian dialogue first, and then we will review the phrases together in English.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
